t.\n\n### Gates (real output)\n- `pytest -q -n auto -m smoke` → **543 passed, 2 skipped**\n- `check_docs --stale` → **OK, 0 broken**\n- `pytest -q -n auto` (full) → **695 passed, 3 skipped**\n- `check.py --gate G3 --phase v1,v2 --jobs 0` → **RESULT: PASS (14/14)**\n\nTwo commits landed on `derived-gate-model` (both re-ran the full gate via the pre-commit hook). **Not pushed** — push-policy is `human`.\n\n### Resume state\n- `docs/run-state` = **RUNNING** (backlog remains) · `docs/next-wi` = **WI-104** (pin the dev toolchain) · `docs/gate` = **G3**\n- `status.md`, the WI-087 Deliverable, and `log.md` are updated.\n- **Owner-only, unchanged:** the v2 spine cut (SR-050/SR-051 Verified, v2 → G3) still rides the queued single-ratify sitting alongside the pending G3 re-attestation and push decision — those remain human calls in the Needs-\\<human> queue."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":546,"cache_read_input_tokens":203394,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":546},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d8a50bec-5ab6-403e-bbf1-ee5b7c14ba85","uuid":"7e6af8a4-353c-4ff5-a3a7-fd318813c0e0","request_id":"req_011CczfTa2viuU4cvz3eLxP9"}
